*-measure-out*/
*.sealed.json
FAILURES.md

# Your global ~/.gitignore_global blanket-ignores .github/ (meant for
# unrelated AI-tool dirs). Un-ignore it here so GitHub Actions workflows
# in this repo are actually tracked.
!/.github/
!/.github/**
